WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.930
Claude moved Anthropic's

00:00:01.777 --> 00:00:03.133
API from Python

00:00:02.944 --> 00:00:03.734
to Rust

00:00:04.254 --> 00:00:05.657
Anthropic migrated

00:00:05.469 --> 00:00:06.871
its Messages API

00:00:06.683 --> 00:00:07.827
from Python to

00:00:07.650 --> 00:00:08.864
Rust after traffic

00:00:08.676 --> 00:00:10.987
grew roughly 1,800

00:00:10.799 --> 00:00:11.989
times from early

00:00:11.801 --> 00:00:13.369
2024 to fall

00:00:13.181 --> 00:00:14.407
2026

00:00:14.926 --> 00:00:15.904
The Rust version

00:00:15.716 --> 00:00:17.402
passed about 98 percent

00:00:17.214 --> 00:00:17.956
of tests in

00:00:17.768 --> 00:00:18.369
April

00:00:18.570 --> 00:00:19.348
yet only a

00:00:19.159 --> 00:00:20.362
quarter of inputs

00:00:20.174 --> 00:00:21.364
matched on production

00:00:21.176 --> 00:00:21.859
traffic

00:00:21.919 --> 00:00:23.109
so agents chased

00:00:22.921 --> 00:00:24.041
down the differences

00:00:24.566 --> 00:00:25.568
The result uses

00:00:25.380 --> 00:00:26.865
about 70 percent less

00:00:26.677 --> 00:00:28.091
CPU per request

00:00:28.033 --> 00:00:29.106
and cuts median

00:00:28.917 --> 00:00:29.860
time to first

00:00:29.672 --> 00:00:30.603
token by about

00:00:30.415 --> 00:00:31.370
20 percent

00:00:31.465 --> 00:00:32.749
with no downtime

00:00:33.270 --> 00:00:34.284
Full story on

00:00:34.095 --> 00:00:34.991
the dashboard
